[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0010","text":"呀哈～！天气超好的～～～\n呐，制作人！给雏菜拍一张嘛～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0020","text":"哦，了解\n按这里就行了吧。那，要拍了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0030","text":"啊哈～\n谢谢你～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0040","text":"怎么样？拍好了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0050","text":"嗯～！\n雏菜被拍得超可爱的～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0060","text":"……确实。拍得很漂亮"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0070","text":"────之前坐车经过的时候，\n海还一片漆黑什么都看不见呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0080","text":"嗯～\n不过今天完美无缺呢～～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0090","text":"呐，制作人\n接下来去那边！在波浪边拍～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0100","text":"嗯，当然\n多拍些好照片吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300300_02_0101","text":"Motion"}]
